{"id":"bbc24bcdd1e5f249","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-range-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Range Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-range-closed-class — ZFC Range Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-range-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-range-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-range-closed-class — ZFC Range Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-map-range.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-range-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-range-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-range-closed-class — ZFC Range Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"32b0abf332b5f4ed\" href=\"?note=32b0abf332b5f4ed\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-map-range.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-map-range.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(v,\\vec a)\">\\(\\Phi(v,\\vec a)\\)</span> is an arbitrary metatheoretic formula with displayed set parameters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\">\\(\\vec a\\)</span> and exactly the free set variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,R,A,B\\in V\">\\(r,R,A,B\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMapRange}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMapRange}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RangeClosedClass}[\\Phi;\\vec a]\">\\(\\mathrm{RangeClosedClass}[\\Phi;\\vec a]\\)</span> is the definitional schema introduced here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}range\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}[\\Phi]\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RangeClosedClass}[\\Phi;\\vec a]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\;\n\\left(\n\\Phi(r,\\vec a)\n\\land\\left[\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Rel}_S(r,A,B)\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(R,\\vec a)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMapRange}_S(R,r)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}range\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}[\\Phi]\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RangeClosedClass}[\\Phi;\\vec a]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\;\n\\left(\n\\Phi(r,\\vec a)\n\\land\\left[\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Rel}_S(r,A,B)\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(R,\\vec a)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMapRange}_S(R,r)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a schema over formulas <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>, not an object-language quantifier over a class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> treated as a set. The range itself is delegated to the canonical set-coded range predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-map-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"32b0abf332b5f4ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-map-range.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi(v,\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"r,R,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMapRange}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RangeClosedClass}[\\Phi;\\vec a]","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}range\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}[\\Phi]\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RangeClosedClass}[\\Phi;\\vec a]\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall r\\;\n\\left(\n\\Phi(r,\\vec a)\n\\land\\left[\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Rel}_S(r,A,B)\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(R,\\vec a)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMapRange}_S(R,r)\\bigr)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1263,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-range-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-range-closed-class]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["32b0abf332b5f4ed","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}